.TH SDL_main_func 3type "SDL 3.5.0" "Simple Directmedia Layer" "SDL3 DATATYPES"
.SH NAME
SDL_main_func \- The prototype for the application\(aqs main() function
.SH SYNOPSIS
.nf
.B #include <SDL3/SDL_main.h>
.PP
.BI "typedef int (SDLCALL *SDL_main_func)(int argc, char *argv[]);
.fi
.SH FUNCTION PARAMETERS
.TP
.I argc
an ANSI-C style main function\(aqs argc\[char46]
.TP
.I argv
an ANSI-C style main function\(aqs argv\[char46]
.SH RETURN VALUE
Returns an ANSI-C main return code; generally 0 is considered successful program completion, and small non-zero values are considered errors\[char46]

.SH AVAILABILITY
This datatype is available since SDL 3\[char46]2\[char46]0\[char46]

